# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the build output and applies the headers
# to matching paths. Everything here is static and there is no auth, no cookies
# and no user input, so these are hardening rather than fixes.
#
# The one that earns its place regardless: Referrer-Policy. This site is a
# bibliography — nearly every page links out to a publisher — and without it
# each of those links hands the full URL the reader was on to the destination.

/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://tile.openstreetmap.org; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# Notes on the CSP above, so the next person does not weaken it by accident:
#
# script-src 'unsafe-inline' — the site runs eleven `is:inline` scripts (theme
#   switch before first paint, mobile nav, the map island, glossary hovers).
#   Astro does not emit hashes for them, so tightening this means either moving
#   each to its own file or generating hashes at build time. Left as-is
#   deliberately: with no user input reaching the DOM and no third-party script
#   host allowed, the remaining XSS surface is content, which item #14 in the
#   worklist closes at the serialisation layer.
#
# img-src tile.openstreetmap.org — the map's tiles. If the tile provider ever
#   changes (see docs/08-WORKLIST.md item #3), change it here too or the map
#   goes blank with only a console error to explain it.
#
# style-src 'unsafe-inline' — Leaflet positions every tile and marker with an
#   inline `style` attribute. Not removable while Leaflet is the map library.

# Hashed build assets are immutable; everything else revalidates.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
